1
00:00:00,393 --> 00:00:01,473
(Penny:)Emotionally.

2
00:00:01,644 --> 00:00:04,564
(Leonard:)Of course, yeah. Emotional chafing.

3
00:00:11,612 --> 00:00:13,782
Hey, do you wanna see something cool?

4
00:00:15,199 --> 00:00:19,409
(Leonard:)I can make this olive go into this glass
without touching it.

5
00:00:19,662 --> 00:00:22,292
- How?
- Physics.

6
00:00:27,587 --> 00:00:29,797
(Penny:)Wow, centrifugal force.

7
00:00:29,964 --> 00:00:33,254
(Leonard:)Actually, it's centripetal force,
which is an inward force...

8
00:00:33,426 --> 00:00:36,766
(Leonard:)...generated by the glass
acting on the olive. Ooh.

9
00:00:37,597 --> 00:00:38,847
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

10
00:00:39,015 --> 00:00:42,145
Now, if you were biting on the olive...

11
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:45,850
(Leonard:)...you'd be in a non-inertial
reference frame and would...

12
00:00:47,273 --> 00:00:50,443
- Are you okay?
- Yeah, I'm okay.

13
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,650
(Leonard:)Did you spill ketchup?

14
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:55,160
(Leonard:)- No.
- I'm not okay.

15
00:00:58,284 --> 00:01:00,164
You don't wanna go
to the emergency room?

